## Third-Party Acknowledgments

This project was inspired by reverse-engineering analysis conducted using
REA (Reverse Engineer Anything) - https://github.com/morluto/rea

The analysis studied Internet Download Manager (IDM) for educational and
interoperability purposes. No IDM code was copied into this project. This
project implements equivalent functionality using standard web APIs
(WebSocket, Chrome Extensions MV3, HTTP Range requests).

